_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：適，猶所也，言報答之辭，必令得所也。余謂適，當也，言報答之辭必有當乎事情也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：适，犹所也，言报答之辞，必令得所也。余谓适，当也，言报答之辞必有当乎事情也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":225,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c00-db0e-11ef-8127-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"呼韓邪","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼韩邪","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c03-db0e-11ef-b36f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂呼韓邪舊約也。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓呼韩邪旧约也。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":249,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c02-db0e-11ef-9f70-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c07-db0e-11ef-b642-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「帝」上有「皇」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「帝」上有「皇」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c06-db0e-11ef-814e-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":296,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c05-db0e-11ef-8ba6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事並見前紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事并见前纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":351,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c08-db0e-11ef-bc55-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"惟，思也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"惟，思也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":417,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c0a-db0e-11ef-a635-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ed787c-db0e-11ef-a6db-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：鞬，音居言翻。方言曰：藏弓爲鞬，藏箭爲韥。丸，卽箭箙也。韥，與韣同；徒谷翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：鞬，音居言翻。方言曰：藏弓为鞬，藏箭为韥。丸，即箭箙也。韥，与韣同；徒谷翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":581,"tongjian_id":"94ec5c0c-db0e-11ef-86c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉昫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昫","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94ed7881-db0e-11ef-b6f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"女媧","people_name_jianti_auto":"女娲","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94ed7882-db0e-11ef-b1e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"空國侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"空国侯","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"94ed7883-db0e-11ef-b135-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉昫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昫","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"94ed7884-db0e-11ef-b81e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"漢武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"汉武帝","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"94ed7885-db0e-11ef-a028-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"侯調","people_name_jianti_auto":"侯调","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"94ed7886-db0e-11ef-965f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"侯暉","people_name_jianti_auto":"侯晖","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"94ed7887-db0e-11ef-92b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"师贤","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"94ed7888-db0e-11ef-92f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"竽管三十六簧。劉昫曰：女媧氏造匏，列管於匏上，內簧其中；爾雅謂之巢。大者曰竽，小者曰和。竽，煦也，立春之氣，煦生萬物也。竽管三十六宮，管在左，和管十三宮，管居中。今之竽笙，並以木代匏而漆之，無復八音矣。瑟，註見前。空侯，世本云：空國侯所造。劉昫曰：漢武帝使樂人侯調所作，以祠太廟。或曰：侯暉所作，其聲坎坎應節，謂之坎侯，聲訛爲箜篌；或謂師賢靡靡樂，非也。舊說一依琴制，今按，其形似瑟而小，七絃，用撥彈之如琵琶。","note_content_jianti_auto":"竽管三十六簧。刘昫曰：女娲氏造匏，列管于匏上，内簧其中；尔雅谓之巢。大者曰竽，小者曰和。竽，煦也，立春之气，煦生万物也。竽管三十六宫，管在左，和管十三宫，管居中。今之竽笙，并以木代匏而漆之，无复八音矣。瑟，注见前。空侯，世本云：空国侯所造。刘昫曰：汉武帝使乐人侯调所作，以祠太庙。或曰：侯晖所作，其声坎坎应节，谓之坎侯，声讹为箜篌；或谓师贤靡靡乐，非也。旧说一依琴制，今按，其形似瑟而小，七弦，用拨弹之如琵琶。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":637,"tongjian_id":"94ed7880-db0e-11ef-a85e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ed788c-db0e-11ef-a56f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：言更請裁賜也。余謂裁，量也，量多少以賜也。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：言更请裁赐也。余谓裁，量也，量多少以赐也。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":643,"tongjian_id":"94ed788b-db0e-11ef-8234-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"司徒掾","official_note":"司徒掾是司徒府的属官，负责文书、参谋等事务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，班彪以司徒掾身份参与讨论北匈奴和亲事宜，提出处理建议，体现了其在中央决策中的辅助作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"司徒掾班彪曰","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9ca3720d-54c9-4a3f-b195-a38db18ddf0b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"邊守尉","official_note":"邊守尉是汉代边境地区的军事和行政长官，负责边防和民族事务。在此段中，孝宣皇帝敕令邊守尉处理匈奴事务，反映了其在边境管理中的关键角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"敕邊守尉曰","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"995336ba-f054-430a-9dd1-e990bca6b50b"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"左骨都侯","official_note":"左骨都侯是匈奴官职，通常为高级军事或行政官员。在此段中，汉朝赐物给左骨都侯，作为对北匈奴贡献的回应，体现了外交中的赏赐策略。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"賜獻馬左骨都侯","start_index":618,"tongjian_id":"64301ce4-a7b7-4822-83e4-339387e7dbab"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"右谷蠡王","official_note":"右谷蠡王是匈奴王爵之一，属于高级贵族，常参与军事和外交事务。在此段中，汉朝同样赐物给右谷蠡王，以安抚北匈奴，显示了对匈奴内部结构的了解。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"右谷蠡王雜繒各四百匹","start_index":628,"tongjian_id":"22c9939b-6605-4737-837f-172c3420b9e5"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":3,"link_death_year":54,"link_td_description":"班彪，字叔皮，右扶风安陵（今陕西省咸阳）人，东汉史学家。汉成帝时越骑校尉班况之孙。汉哀帝时广平太守班稚之子。姑母班婕妤是汉成帝嫔妃。班彪是班固、班超和班昭的父亲，与前两位合称「三班」。","link_td_id":"Q10007593","link_td_number_id":10885,"people_name":"班彪","people_name_jianti_auto":"班彪","people_xingming":"班彪","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"94ed788f-db0e-11ef-9357-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝宣皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝宣皇帝","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"94ed7890-db0e-11ef-97b5-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘病已•刘询]"},{"people_name":"北單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"北单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮蒲奴","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"94ed7892-db0e-11ef-966f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮比","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"94ed7893-db0e-11ef-ac0a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮比]"},{"link_death_year":-31,"link_td_description":"呼韩邪单于（？－前31年），名稽侯狦，是西汉后期匈奴单于之一，挛鞮氏，虚闾权渠单于的儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10000775","link_td_number_id":356590,"people_name":"呼韓邪","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼韩邪","people_xingming":"呼韩邪","start_index":280,"tongjian_id":"94ed7896-db0e-11ef-98a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-36,"link_td_description":"郅支单于，全称郅支骨都侯单于，名呼屠吾斯，是匈奴的单于，于前56年—前36年在位，第12代虚闾权渠单于之子，呼韩邪单于的哥哥。","link_td_id":"Q10000539","link_td_number_id":366934,"people_name":"郅支","people_name_jianti_auto":"郅支","people_xingming":"郅支","start_index":284,"tongjian_id":"94ed7897-db0e-11ef-b2ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝宣帝","start_index":293,"tongjian_id":"94ed7898-db0e-11ef-966d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-36,"link_td_description":"郅支单于，全称郅支骨都侯单于，名呼屠吾斯，是匈奴的单于，于前56年—前36年在位，第12代虚闾权渠单于之